OL,3,GNEWSAApology for football steward let
OL,4,Ago after 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football steward whose service was
OL,7,Fabruptly terminated by email after more
OL,8,Fthan half a century with a club, has
OL,9,Fbeen offered a new role.
OL,11,FTim Goodchild, from Wimborne, said he
OL,12,Fwas shocked after receiving the message
OL,13,Ffrom AFC Bournemouth, telling him his
OL,14,Fcontract would not be renewed for the
OL,15,Fnew season.
OL,17,FThe email sparked a backlash when it
OL,18,Fwas shared online, prompting the club
OL,19,Fto review how it had communicated
OL,20,Fchanges to some matchday staff.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
