OL,3,GNEWSAApology for football steward let
OL,4,Ago after 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club's head of business, Jim
OL,7,FFrevola, said: "The reality is we just
OL,8,Fcommunicated poorly... it was our
OL,9,Fmistake."
